-- N5 example sentences, batch 9: 〜なくてもいい, で (reason), 何の, の (pronoun),
-- 〜ないで, もうすぐ, 〜ている (habit), まだ〜ていません, 〜がある (possession) and
-- 何も.
--
-- One checker change came out of this batch and is in the same commit: a run
-- made only of PARTICLES is no longer treated as shredded text. を, へ and の
-- are not in the dictionary — it holds words — so they carry no gloss and count
-- as bare kana. Alone that is invisible, because the check wants a run of two;
-- but 安いのを買います puts two of them together, and the sentence was rejected
-- for being ordinary Japanese.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

  -- nakutemo-ii-n5
  ('sent-ex-nakutemo-1', 'lang-ja', '行かなくてもいいです。', 'いかなくて も いい です。', 'lvl-ja-n5', 'authored', true),
  ('sent-ex-nakutemo-2', 'lang-ja', '買わなくてもいいです。', 'かわなくて も いい です。', 'lvl-ja-n5', 'authored', true),
